        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "\"Greed 3: Old Enemies Returning\" is the last part of the thrilling \"Greed\" triology! Dr. Goodwin's miracle cure is once again under threat and Sara has contacted you for help. Old enemies are up to new tricks at Pontoon Laboratories and this time they are willing to kill to get their hands on the cure.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "«Greed 3: Old Enemies Returning» es la última parte de la emocionante trilogía «Greed». ¡La cura milagrosa del Dr. Goodwin vuelve a estar amenazada, y Sara te ha contactado para pedirte ayuda! Viejos enemigos traman nuevas artimañas en Pontoon Laboratories y esta vez están dispuestos a matar para hacerse con la cura.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
